Z||000008||JJ-85-2M6||01-16-2001||09:04 PM||||From pontiac Motor vehicle Specs for 85: 85 GT weighs 2627 lbs and SE weighs 2486, base coupe weighs 2461.  This is with full fluids and a tank of gas.  It states that this is with standard options only.  AC weighs 44.09 lbs! and AT weighs 53.57 lbs!  It doesn't say what the V6 adds.  Everything else: locks, windows, and mirrors adds from 2-5 lbs. each.  ||||reg||1
